              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Judgement for our wicked ways. We have fallen short of his ideal, so he averts his gaze from us and sends his vile abomination to terrorize us.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Resistance_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Hierarch_Lucien_LM-NIGHT_009.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520132,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Only through purity can we atone. Only through the removal of the criminal and the denial of the new can we appease him.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Resistance_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Hierarch_Lucien_LM-NIGHT_010.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520132,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-SKY-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "Ask him if we could not simply find and destroy this Malughast in exchange for entry to the Mana Source. How difficult could one monster be?",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_LinNoHat_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-NIGHT_067.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1524717,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Malughast cannot die. It raises the dead to serve it and screams the scream that freezes stars. 'Tis not a subtle thing, easy to find... if you wish.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Resistance_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Hierarch_Lucien_LM-NIGHT_011.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 1520132,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC01_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "The Malughast makes its wretched nest in a clearing beyond the Village. Seek it if you dare, but we will not mourn you.",
                "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Lemur_Resistance_E_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Hierarch_Lucien_LM-NIGHT_012.mp3",
