      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But what are we to do? They say the beast is immortal. So we cower in our homes. Or flee to the Wildlands.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_CitizenF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Mary-Crane_Watson_LM-NIGHT_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520133,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-SKY-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yes, like that one poor fellow we met before. We haven't had the chance to ask about him yet.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_LinNoHat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-NIGHT_065.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524717,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You've met benighted Ichabod, have you? Save your pity. He was a criminal and had to be exiled. We can only protect so many with Mana so low.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_CitizenF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Mary-Crane_Watson_LM-NIGHT_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520133,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-SKY-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Mana is low? That is unusual and at odds with the increased Malughast activity. The answer must be in the Monitoring Station.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_LinNoHat_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-NIGHT_066.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524717,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If you want to reach the source of the Night Forest's Mana, only Lucien has the Key. Maybe he will help you now that our defenses are ready.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Crane_CitizenF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Mary-Crane_Watson_LM-NIGHT_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1520133,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-NIGHT-NPC05_Persona",
